Radius of path of charged particle
$r=\frac{\sqrt{2 m E_k}}{B q}E_k$ remains same, so
$\begin{aligned}
\frac{r_1}{r_2} & =\sqrt{\frac{m_1}{m_2}} \cdot \frac{q_2}{q_1} \\
& =\sqrt{\frac{4}{16}} \times \frac{2}{1}=\frac{1}{2} \times \frac{2}{1}=\frac{1}{1}
\end{aligned}$<br/>So, correct choice is (3).

